{"ID":"20240620090402-isjuniy","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240620090402-isjuniy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620090402-isjuniy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620090416-nboa2b0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620090422-m0yf2bx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620090416-a1qrktt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"红景天","type":"doc","updated":"20240902145223"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240620090416-hr9tta0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620090416-hr9tta0","updated":"20240620090416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产西藏、四川、云南等地。\n【性状】\t根茎呈圆柱形，粗短，略弯曲，少数有分枝。表面棕色或者褐色，粗糙有皱纹，主根圆柱形，粗短，质轻，表皮疏松，可以数层剥落。断面棕褐色，异形维管束花纹状，内有黄色膜质表皮。气味芳香，味微苦涩、后甜。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，平。\n【功效】\t益气活血，通脉平喘。用于气虚血瘀，胸痹心痛，中风偏瘫，倦怠气喘。"}]},{"ID":"20240620090416-a1qrktt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620090416-a1qrktt","updated":"20240620090416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206084520-9hgcmjo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722155000-5w3nf9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722155000-5w3nf9u","updated":"20240722155000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 1-20240722155000-vqiv9x3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722161343-ao82eyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722161343-ao82eyz","updated":"20240722161343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 10-20240722161343-5acvfph.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620090416-br3egw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620090416-br3egw0","updated":"20240722155012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天-20240722145839-y4uezeg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722160449-pcnv02o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722160449-pcnv02o","updated":"20240722160952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 811px;","style":"width: 801px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 5-20240722160449-4b7yxut.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 801px;\" parent-style=\"width: 811px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 366px;","style":"width: 356px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 8-20240722160952-uhky2v6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 356px;\" parent-style=\"width: 366px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722160355-jqk30yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722160355-jqk30yd","updated":"20240722160854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 4-20240722160355-5t4vxwy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 498px;","style":"width: 488px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 6-20240722160633-mv06z5t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 488px;\" parent-style=\"width: 498px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722160536-ep4kbgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722160536-ep4kbgh","updated":"20240722161251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 687px;","style":"width: 677px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 7-20240722160845-mkf06fv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 677px;\" parent-style=\"width: 687px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 9-20240722161251-7p5hsmn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722155217-58qk1bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722155217-58qk1bv","updated":"20240722160216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 715px;","style":"width: 705px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 2-20240722155217-h9t6hs9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 705px;\" parent-style=\"width: 715px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 405px;","style":"width: 395px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红景天 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红景天 3-20240722160216-rq40rcm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 395px;\" parent-style=\"width: 405px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722154439-l0ux65s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240722154439-l0ux65s"}},{"ID":"20240902145213-yytfcne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-yytfcne","updated":"20240902145223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：红景天"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-bugy8ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-bugy8ul","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红景天《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-q2uuv03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-q2uuv03","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HónɡJǐnɡTiān"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-o7dmrev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-o7dmrev","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】景天科红景天属植物红景天Rhodiolasaera（Prain）Fu，以全草入药。9～10月采集，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-583h71p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-583h71p","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、涩，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-3nigb6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-3nigb6v","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清肺止咳，止血，止带。用于肺热咳嗽，咯血，白带；外用治跌打损伤，烧烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-lx6ksnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-lx6ksnl","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1～3钱；外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-wmbopb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-wmbopb4","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-qvr8qx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-qvr8qx5","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红景天《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-lfqc52m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-lfqc52m","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《西藏常用中草药》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-hjz2e74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-hjz2e74","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HónɡJǐnɡTiān"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-ld09t1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-ld09t1e","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】扫罗玛尔布（藏名）"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-6mcm6fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-6mcm6fe","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为景天科植物全瓣红景天的全草。7～9月采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-zijs39e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-zijs39e","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高10～20厘米。根粗壮，圆锥形，肉质，褐黄色，根颈部具多数须根。根茎短，粗壮，圆柱形，被多数覆瓦状排列的鳞片状的叶。从茎顶端之叶腋抽出数条花茎，花茎上下部均有肉质叶，叶片椭圆形，边缘具粗锯齿，先端锐尖，基部楔形，几无柄。聚伞花序顶生，花红色。蓇葖果。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-rj3bhck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-rj3bhck","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于高山岩石处。分布西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-kmxyzub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-kmxyzub","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性寒，味甘涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-nxa9fh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-nxa9fh8","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】活血止血，清肺止咳。治咳血，咯血，肺炎咳嗽，妇女白带。外用治跌打损伤，汤火伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-3lpfukc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-3lpfukc","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱，外用：捣敷或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-27buvvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-27buvvv","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-rmzau71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-rmzau71","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红景天《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-mtlkyae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-mtlkyae","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《西藏常用中草药》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-mcqrtqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-mcqrtqx","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HónɡJǐnɡTiān"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-2wrjefy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-2wrjefy","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RootofKirilowRhodiola"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-bqy9sw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-bqy9sw6","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】扫罗玛尔布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-tupm55g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-tupm55g","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-svbg4np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-svbg4np","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为景天科植物库页红景天、圣地红景天、唐古特红景天等的全尊。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-aq1s8v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-aq1s8v2","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.RhodiolasachalinensisA.Bor.[Sedumsachalinensis（A.Bor.）Vorosh.]2.Rhodiolasacra（PrainexHamet）S.H.Fu[SedumsacraPrainexHamet]3.Rhodiolaalgida（Ledeb.）Fisch.etMey.var.tangutica（Maxim.）S.H.Fu"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-7uf3ea5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-7uf3ea5","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全草春、秋两季均可采收，以秋季为好，除去地上枯萎茎叶，挖掘全株，大的根茎作种用，除去泥土，晒干或在70℃以下烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-u1zu522","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-u1zu522","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-1jiaiq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-1jiaiq6","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．库页红景天多年生草本。根粗壮，有分枝，通常直立，少数模生；根颈粗短，先端被多数膜质鳞片状叶。花莫高6-30cm。下部的叶较小，疏生，上部的叶较大，密生，叶片长圆状匙形、长圆状菱形成长圆状披针形，长7-40mm，宽4-9mm，先端急尖至渐尖，茎部楔形，边缘上部有粗牙齿、下部近全缘。聚伞花序伞房状，顶生，花密集，雌雄异株；萼片4，披针状线形，长1-3mm；花瓣4，稀为5，黄色或黄绿色，线状倒披针形或长圆形，长2-6mm；雄花中有雄蕊8，较花瓣长，有不发育的心皮存在；雌花中心皮4，花柱向外弯曲；鳞片4，长圆形，先端微缺。蓇葖果，披针形或线状披针形，直立，长6-8mm，喙长约1mm。种子长圆形至披针形，长2mm，宽0.6mm。花期4-6月，果期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-i647nir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-i647nir","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．圣地红景天多年生草本，高10-20cm。根粗壮，圆柱形，肉质，褐黄色，有分枝；根颈短，被多数披针状三角形鳞片。花茎少数，直立，不分枝，稻秆色，老时被乳头状突起。叶互生，几无柄；叶片肉质，倒卵形或倒卵状长圆形，长8-llmm，宽4-6mm，先端锐尖，基部楔形，边缘具4-5浅裂。伞房花序，顶生，花两性；萼片5，披针状三角形，长3-5mm，宽1.2mm；花瓣5,白色，狭长卵形，长10-11mm，宽1.2-2mm；雄蕊10，花药紫色；鳞片5，近正方形；心皮5，狭披针形，花枝细。蓇葖果，长约6mm。种子长圆状披针形，褐色。花期8月，果期9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-qhzo27s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-qhzo27s","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．唐古特红景天多年生草本，高10-30cm。主根粗长，有分枝，根颈无残留的老技，先端被三角形鳞片。花茎多数，丛生；花茎上的叶互生，无柄；叶片线形，长l-1.5cm，宽约lmm，先端钝渐尖。花序紧密，伞房状，雌雄异株；雄株花茎高10-17cm，花序下有苞叶；萼片5，线状长圆形，先端钝；花瓣5，粉红色，长圆状披针形；雄蕊10，2轮，对瓣的长约2.5mm，对萼的长约4。5mm；鳞片5，四方形，先端微缺；心皮5，狭披针形，不育；雌株花茎高15-30cm；花萼、花瓣、鳞片与雄花基本相同，心皮发育成5枚蓇葖果，长约1cm，紫红色，喙长约lmm，直立或稍外弯。种子多数，有网纹，具翅，淡褐色。花期5-8月，果期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-tqjfiko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-tqjfiko","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-v8jolrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-v8jolrm","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.生于海拔1600-2500m的山坡草地或林下、碎石滩及高山冻原。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-9b2gftf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-9b2gftf","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于海拔2700-4600m的高山草地和岩石缝处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-78v3xuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-78v3xuo","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.生于海拔2000-4700m的高山岩石缝隙中，高山砾石带或近水边。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-p53md92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-p53md92","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于黑龙江、吉林等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-psxebnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-psxebnt","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于西藏及云南西北部。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-hggqa2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-hggqa2x","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于宁夏、甘肃、青海、四川、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-xsc78jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-xsc78jg","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-gpteo1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-gpteo1p","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性库页红景天野生于海拔1700-2300m的山地，平均气温4.9-－7℃，年降雨量1000mm以上，年日照时数2200-2500h，无霜期60-75d，多生于石壁上、山坡底部、沟谷两侧沙堆上。喜温暖凉爽气候，抗严寒、怕水涝。以选海拔稍高、夏季昼夜温差较大、阳光充足、土层深厚、排水良好、富含腐殖质的中性或微酸性砂质壤土栽培为宜。重粘土、盐碱地、低洼积水地不宜栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-3qhovh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-3qhovh3","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术繁殖方法用种子、根茎繁殖。种子繁殖，育苗移栽法。种子细小，千粒重0.13-0.15g，适宜发芽温度15-20℃，贮存1年丧失发芽力。选成熟饱满的新种子，可用赤霉素加ABT生根粉浸种，能促使发芽及生根，出苗率达70％。育菌可用温室或塑料大棚、室外阳畦。春播4月；秋播10月，尤以秋播为佳。条播或撒播。播后覆细土及盖草。经常保持苗床湿润，防止人畜践踏床面，阳光过强时要适当遮荫。培育1年，于4月下旬至5月初或9月中、下旬移栽。按行距10-15cm开沟，株距7-10cm，将幼苗斜放于沟内，覆土2cm。根茎繁殖，结合收获时，选取较大根茎，剪成3-5cm的小段，稍晾1-2d，使伤口愈合。春栽4-5月；秋栽9-10月，以秋裁为宜，按行珠距20-25cm×10-15cm，斜栽，覆土，稍加镇压。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-c0zuees","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-c0zuees","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理幼苗期要注意松土除草，经常浇水，保持土壤湿润。遇雨季要及时排除积水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-pde98uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-pde98uc","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治有蚜虫为害幼嫩茎叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-pjkbf7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-pjkbf7x","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-1pkq79y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-1pkq79y","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．库页红景天根和茎含酪醇（tyrosol）和毛柳甙（salidroside），又称红景天甙（rhodioloside）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-uuyu6zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-uuyu6zm","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．圣地红景天根分离出13种成分，经鉴定，其中九种为：咖啡酸（caffeicacid），伞形花内酯（umbelliferone），酪醇（tyrosol），没食子酸（gallicacid），没食子酸乙酯（gallicacidethylester），山奈酚（kaemoferol），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），胡萝卜甙（daucosterol）及红景天甙（rhodioloside）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-92fwtip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-92fwtip","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】寒；甘；涩"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-yhy0b4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-yhy0b4z","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-8nd1pow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-8nd1pow","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】补气清肺；益智养心；收涩止血；散瘀消肿。主气虚体弱；病后畏寒；气短乏力；肺热咳嗽；咯血；白带腹泻；跌打损伤；烫火伤；神经症；高原反应"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-slnqncr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-slnqncr","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-9g。外用：适量，捣敷；或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145213-co9qckk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145213-co9qckk","updated":"20240902145225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145215-kawotuj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902145215-kawotuj","updated":"20240902145225"}},{"ID":"20240902145217-zxlkews","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145217-zxlkews","updated":"20240902145225"}}]}